{"id":"2d2cf287148220bf","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-pr-representable.md","title":"PR Functions Representable","display":"thm-pr-representable — PR Functions Representable","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-pr-representable","aliases":["92-thm-pr-representable"],"display":"thm-pr-representable — PR Functions Representable","depends_on":["[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[92-df-representable]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-df-tuple-graph-code]]","[[92-thm-representability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-pr-representable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-pr-representable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pr-representable — PR Functions Representable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d03aab2a94232c0e\" href=\"?note=d03aab2a94232c0e\" title=\"92-df-tuple-graph-code\">92-df-tuple-graph-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0b2170bf5b3075ce\" href=\"?note=0b2170bf5b3075ce\" title=\"92-thm-representability\">92-thm-representability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f : \\mathbb{N}^k \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(f : \\mathbb{N}^k \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (function parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive function class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_k(f)\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(\\Gamma_k(f)\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (encoded graph of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d03aab2a94232c0e\" href=\"?note=d03aab2a94232c0e\" title=\"92-df-tuple-graph-code\">92-df-tuple-graph-code</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> (representability predicate in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pr\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n(f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(\\Gamma_k(f)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pr\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n(f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(\\Gamma_k(f)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>是原始递归函数</li>\n<li>本书的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span>以自然数集合为输入，所以函数可表示性通过<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"d03aab2a94232c0e\" href=\"?note=d03aab2a94232c0e\" title=\"92-df-tuple-graph-code\">92-df-tuple-graph-code</a>中唯一固定的配对编码图<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_k(f)\">\\(\\Gamma_k(f)\\)</span>表达</li>\n<li>所有原始递归函数在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可表示</li>\n<li>这是可表示性定理的基础</li>\n<li>这里得到的是图码集的逐numeral强表示；若要使用通常带自由输入、输出变量且证明唯一输出的“函数表示公式”，还需另行给出从图码表示到该多元公式的解码与唯一性论证</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","a